e serve stdinDEVNULL, ready<=3.0s/cancel-aware; первый kill-switch/TTL guard обязателен. Executable cache path+mtime_ns+size; config cache mtime_ns+size, invalid/missing boolean ->false с redacted warning. Exact counter regressions сохранены.\",\n      \"verification_ids\": [\n        \"VER-001\",\n        \"VER-005\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RISK-005\",\n      \"scenario\": \"Расщеплённые marker/tool/UTF8 или ended duplicate искажают reasoning/usage\",\n      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n      \"impact\": \"high\",\n      \"mitigation\": \"Canonical delta-only assembler, incremental scrubber, all split points, step-id dedup/native-call-id dedup; end barrier independent terminal.\",\n      \"verification_ids\": [\n        \"VER-001\",\n        \"VER-005\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RISK-006\",\n      \"scenario\": \"Корректный early-error upstream сам восстанавливается, но bridge status пометит had_output\",\n      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n      \"impact\": \"medium\",\n      \"mitigation\": \"Status provenance отдельно от model counters, no had_output/clock reset; exact legacy early_error tests + FakeServe variant.\",\n      \"verification_ids\": [\n        \"VER-001\",\n        \"VER-005\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RISK-007\",\n      \"scenario\": \"Квота Zen/103KB TTFT/DSH rendering пока не проверены\",\n      \"probability\": \"high\",\n      \"impact\": \"high\",\n      \"mitigation\": \"F23 observation может устареть; не утверждать текущую квоту, H0..H9 live acceptance после rollout. FakeSuite не заменяет UI/реальный egress.\",\n      \"verification_ids\": [\n        \"VER-001\",\n        \"VER-005\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RISK-008\",\n      \"scenario\": \"Полный lint/type gate красный до изменения\",\n      \"probability\": \"high\",\n      \"impact\": \"medium\",\n      \"mitigation\": \"Decode wire JSON as object with isinstance narrowing/TypedDict; new code no Any/casts-to-Any/type-ignore. VER-004 uses isolated bridge cwd + temporary include/extraPaths: all3 errorCount==0, new test0diagnostics, server Any<=125each/nonAny per-rule and total<=720, step<=194; changed legacy code0reportAny/reportExplicitAny/reportUnusedCallResult. Preserve public module attribute server.CATALOG_SOURCE and HTTP catalog_source: module-level CATALOG_SOURCE = \\\"static\\\", never rename it or external test references. Replace reload_catalog global CATALOG_SOURCE/reassignment with typed def _set_catalog_source(source: str) -> None: globals()[\\\"CATALOG_SOURCE\\\"] = source; keep only _catalog_mtime/_catalog_ids in reload_catalog global declaration. Preserve static import zen_catalog as zc in the normal-server else branch (original import server.py:67); it remains the only permitted E402 location if a finding exists, zero E402 findings is valid; guard proc is not None before both final stream .returncode reads. EVD-076 observed errorCount0 without # type: ignore; tests/test_catalog_mode.py:64,93 unchanged,8tests PASS on copy. coder_target_files remains exactly3; no config/dependency/new module. Full all3 Stage3 gate NOT_RUN. Ruff==0.17.2 legacy ranges use only --range={start}:1-{end}:999; reject any old/new diff hunk intersecting _run_env/_stream_google_sse/_execute_google_once and check their literal raw hashes before and after formatter. Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"-