ternal a3 review required, no author vote.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"rework_resolutions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RW-001\",\n      \"pass\": \"a5\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated probes observed, actual Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A5-F-001\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"Units MiB. EVD-079 final actual helper peak=31.718750; helper_estimate36.0 reserves 4.281250 for Stage3 helper code/lease/drain bookkeeping (design allowance, not live proof). Serve idle156.8 + helper36.0 =192.8; probe8.0 -> combined200.8; per_slot_ceiling216.0 gives15.2>=15 MiB for103KB prompts.6*216=1296 shared;1296+256=1552.0<=0.80*2048=1638.4; station headroom86.4.6slots/12waiters/cap3 unchanged. H3 NOT_RUN until live6parallel103KB×3; any actual slot>216 or total>1638.4 blocks H7 without waiver. Helpers/probes/load must be summed, not omitted.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/0/details/resource_accounting/rss\",\n        \"/quality_scenarios/8\",\n        \"/risks/2\",\n        \"/evolution/H3_rollout_gate\",\n        \"/high_load_envelope/memory_ssot\",\n        \"/high_load_envelope/capacity_formula\",\n        \"/verification_surface/4/process_resource_oracle/resources/rss\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-076/EVD-077/EVD-079 plus exact role-plan/packet/semantic/fingerprint checks; external a6/r15 Council pending; actual Stage3/H0..H9 NOT_RUN.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false,\n      \"dissent\": {\n        \"seat\": \"realist\",\n        \"family\": \"Muse\",\n        \"round\": \"D1 panel/arch/r14\",\n        \"priority\": \"non-blocking\",\n        \"majority\": \"xAI+Anthropic 2/3 blocking\",\n        \"preserved\": true,\n        \"outcome\": \"RW-001 blocking as agreed by majority; dissent retained without reclassifying consensus.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RW-002\",\n      \"pass\": \"a5\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated probes observed, actual Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A5-F-002\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease. Mandatory clean-room GroupB oracle: empty temporary HOME with no ~/.opencode/bin/opencode; monkeypatch.setattr(server, \\\"OPENCODE_BIN\\\", str(fake_serve_bin)); actual parent -> helper_proc -> fake_serve_bin, not in-process mock. Parent uses subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); helper uses subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). Prove child executable and all serve arguments exactly equal passed fake, same owned child_pgid, zero OPENCODE_BIN in serve_env, no broader whitelist. Spy/audit helper I/O plus early-exit structural assertions prove zero state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json accesses and no sqlite3/http.client/http.server/zen_catalog loaded; reload_catalog/_DEFAULT_RESILIENCE and server globals absent. Reject every invalid six-argument length/value before spawn. Retain EOF/TERM/lease/reaper/listener proof fault oracles: this test does not replace them. Actual Stage3 test NOT_RUN; EVD-079 local minimal chain observed.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/0/details/helper_cli_contract\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/spawn\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/crash_recovery/creation\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/crash_recovery/startup_reaper\",\n        \"/threat_model/threats/0\",\n        \"/threat_model/threats/2\",\n        \"/verification_surface/4/clean_room_helper_oracle\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-076/EVD-077/EVD-079 plus exact role-plan/packet/semantic/fingerprint checks; external a6/r15 Council pending; actual Stage3/H0..H9 NOT_RUN.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-001\",\n      \"pass\": \"a5\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated probes observed, actual Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A5-F-003\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"Explicit --config on every Ruff call; formatter output must equal original candidate bytes and frozen guards; exact command passed normal/hostile user config.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/verification_surface/3/command\",\n        \"/verification_surface/3/expected\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-076/EVD-077/EVD-079 plus exact role-plan/packet/semantic/fingerprint checks; external a6/r15 Council pending; actual Stage3/H0..H9 NOT_RUN.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-002\",\n      \"pass\": \"a5\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated probes observed, actual Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A5-F-004\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"Cycle6/version6.0/architect06 hash and allowlist; external a6/r15 pending, no panel verdict from author.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/cycle\",\n        \"/packet_version\",\n        \"/role_plan\",\n        \"/scope/architect_write_allowlist\",\n        \"/approval/rationale\",\n        \"/summary\",\n        \"/independent_review/rationale\",\n        \"/handoff_state\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-076/EVD-077/EVD-079 plus exact role-plan/packet/semantic/fingerprint checks; external a6/r15 Council pending; actual Stage3/H0..H9 NOT_RUN.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"evidence_refs\": [\n    \"EVD-070\",\n    \"EVD-071\",\n    \"EVD-072\",\n    \"EVD-073\",\n    \"EVD-074\",\n    \"EVD-075\",\n    \"EVD-076\",\n    \"EVD-077\",\n    \"EVD-078\",\n    \"EVD-079\"\n  ],\n  \"rework_resolutions_a3\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RW-001\",\n      \"pass\": \"a3\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; future implementation/live gates NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A3-F-001\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"Ru